#### 18.2 Grace API module

```javascript
// /mobile/src/api/grace.js
import client from './client';

export const sendGraceQuery = async (query) => {
  const res = await client.post('/api/grace/assistant', {
    query,
  });

  return res.data; // { text: "...", metadata: {...} }
};
```

Backend side (conceptual):

- `/api/grace/assistant` routes to your AI layer (Copilot/Claude) with:
  - Context: NO‑TOW policy
  - Emergency protocol steps
  - Unit/breakdown info if provided
- Response always:
  - Focuses on repair‑only actions
  - Avoids tow/winch suggestions
  - Can suggest: technician dispatch, safe routing, vendor repair, protocol steps

